cff-version: 1.2.0
title: TEMOA-Piedmont
message: >-
  If you use TEMOA-Piedmont in your work, please cite the article
  listed under "preferred-citation" below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Farzaneh
    family-names: Amir Kavei
