abstract: >-
  A single-region model instance for long-term energy planning of the
  Piedmont region (Italy) from 2011 to 2050, developed within an extended
  version of the TEMOA (Tools for Energy Modeling Optimization and Analysis)
  modeling framework, in an open-source and open-data environment.
repository-code: 'https://github.com/MAHTEP/TEMOA-Piedmont'
url: 'http://www.mahtep.polito.it/'
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - energy system optimization
  - energy planning
  - regional energy systems
  - TEMOA
  - Piedmont
  - Italy
  - open source
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
